<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bk sets warrants on Cheung Kong.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bk sets warrants on Cheung Kong.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London Branch, said on Friday it will issue 50 million American-style call warrants on shares of Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$73.75	 PREMIUM	   16 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.18	  GEARING	   6.25x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  05.JAN.98	MIN EXER LOT    10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	LISTING DATE    26.FEB.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$73.75	 PAY DATE	  24.FEB.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  PHYSICAL DELIVERY ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
